          Recently the Leaders of the Fennin Ro community met to discuss the future of role-playing on our server At this Council, the concept of 'Common Law' was proposed, and as a result, many of the citizens of Norrath have voiced their opinions and goals for this new system.<br>
          <br>
          One of our primary objectives of Common Law is to bring unity on the server to follow a common goal. We all want to make Norrath an exciting place, and it is not our desire to exclude anyone who wishes to join us on this journey. In an effort to include those who may take a different path than us, I have renamed The Fennin Ro Guild Hall. Henceforth known as The Collective of Old Fennin, we invite all residents of Fennin Ro, whether in guilds or not, to come and join with us as we forge an exciting new future.<br>
          <br>
